            <h2 class="pipe">Asphalt Paving, Site Development & Fieldstone Masonry in Upton, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> delivers full-service site excavation, residential driveway paving, and <a href="/worcester-county/hardscape-contractor-upton-ma">custom stone masonry</a> for property owners in <strong>Upton, Massachusetts</strong>. Located in southern Worcester County, Upton's rugged topography contains dense granite ledge, rocky soils, and steep elevation contours. Severe winter freezing causes massive ground expansion that easily damages poorly constructed asphalt driveways and causes unreinforced retaining walls to collapse. S. Phaneuf & Associates solves these challenges by excavating to stable subsoil, installing deep aggregate bases, and constructing reinforced masonry walls across Upton.</p>
