            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: How does S. Phaneuf & Associates excavate granite ledge rock in Upton, MA?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates uses hydraulic excavators fitted with heavy rock breakers to fracture subgrade granite ledge rock common in Upton. Fractured rock is excavated and removed or processed on-site for structural fill, followed by compacting an 8-inch aggregate gravel base to provide a level foundation for paving or building footings.</p>

            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: What is the maintenance protocol for asphalt driveways in Upton, MA?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates recommends crack filling and sealcoating asphalt driveways in Upton every 3 years. Hot-pour rubberized crack filler seals open joints against water intrusion, while coal-tar or asphalt emulsion sealcoating prevents surface oxidation and chemical breakdown caused by winter de-icing salts.</p>
